+- **PHASE C — ARC north-star progress (exp4201 +1; exp4202 LIVE solver-vs-floor).**
+- **PHASE D — reserved slots (exp4203 SOTA-ingestion; exp4204 registry/gaps hygiene;
+  exp4205 hardware continuity; exp4206 capstone).**
+
