+## 6. Hardware & model requirements
+
+- **RTX 3090 ×2 (CUDA)** — Phase A LoRA-RFT training + held-out eval (the headline GPU work).
+- **Trainable NON-Qwen base (cached):** `google/gemma-4-12B-it` (primary; QLoRA fits the 3090s)
